Z||000000||DaRkLoRD||02-15-2001||08:22 PM||||After talking with B lo 0 a bit in the fall about his online car stereo shop, I decided to set up my own online store with a company called Vstore.com. The store sells health products, such as vitamins, herbal supplements as well as health-related books and videos. <BR>I'm making a website to go with it, with free articles etc. but all I have so far is the store. I didn't set the prices, and I only get a small commission from the sales..<P>I wanted to wait until the rest of the site was done before I told anyone about the store, but well.. I've been busy and all I have done so far is the business card, registered the domain name, and asked a few people to write articles for the site. Unfortunately, since I haven't advertised the store, no one's bought anything.. and if I don't get a sale soon, it will be shut down. I tried to buy something myself, but for some reason vstore won't ship to Canada... like many online retailers and eBay sellers... quite annoying... so if anyone feels like buying something, let me thank you in advance for saving my store and contributing to my Fiero Fund.. (or school bills, whichever comes first...)<P>the URL for the store is: <A HREF="http://naturalhealthproducts.vstorehealth.com" TARGET=_blank>http://naturalhealthproducts.vstorehealth.com</A> <P>the domain name I have registered for this site is <A HREF="http://www.natural-health.ca/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.natural-health.ca/</A>  but it's not active yet since I just have it parked until the site is ready.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.digitalfusion.on.ca/nhcard.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>   <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>   <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A><p>[This message has been edited by DaRkLoRD (edited 02-15-2001).]||||reg||14
Z||000001||loafer87gt||02-15-2001||08:30 PM||||Site looks just great! Really professional look to it and it loads up right away on my DSL connection. What programs did you use to make it? I did my first website last year, but I did most of the images in Photoshop as animated GIF's and the page seems to take forever to load. I'd like to learn how to do some stuff in Flash to make things move a long a little quicker. Once again, good job||||reg||1
Z||000002||DaRkLoRD||02-15-2001||08:34 PM||||The layout etc was all done by Vstore, I just configured it. this is designed to be a small part of a new site with information on alternative health, etc.<P>Glad you like the store.. I hope everyone likes the rest of the site as much. (cause that'll be the only part really designed by me!)<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||7
